  <jpcrp_cor:TargetPeriodDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">2025年３月末</jpcrp_cor:TargetPeriodDescriptionOfMetricsRelatedToPolicyOnDevelopmentOfHumanResourcesAndInternalEnvironmentAndTargetsAndPerformanceUsingSuchMetrics>
